    LAST PERIOD               0.311          0.544             0.217          0.234             0.472          0.222

    NEXT PERIOD               0.198          0.321            -0.013         -0.146            -0.185         -0.174

    1 YEAR AHEAD             -0.051         -0.058             0.157          0.158            -0.106         -0.100

