      CONCURRENT AND PRELIMINARY ESTIMATION SHOW CLEARLY SIGNIFICANT SEASONALITY FOR RECENT PERIODS (LAST YEAR).

      ONE-YEAR AHEAD FORECAST FUNCTION CONTAINS CLEARLY SIGNIFICANT SEASONALITY.




